      ]
    },
    {
      "from_agent": "Security Auditor",
      "to_agent": "Reviewer",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-26T10:02:11Z",
      "notes": [
        "Security audit PASS — 0 Critical/High findings. 1 Medium observation: legacy-format error message at config.ts:235-238 leaks the hostname key in the error string (recommend masking). 2 Low observations: no max-length validation on token/id/label/host fields; host field not validated against a hostname pattern (relevant for WP-005/007 downstream usage). All ACs confirmed met. Code is clear of hardcoded secrets and handles sensitive data responsibly. Approved for code review."
      ]
    },
    {
      "from_agent": "Reviewer",
      "to_agent": "Documentation",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-26T10:04:32Z",
      "notes": [
        "Code review PASS — no blocking issues. Two documentation-forward items logged: (1) document the _defaultsCoverageGuard pattern in config/README.md; (2) clarify the {} vs [] empty-credential asymmetry in user-facing docs. One medium-priority debt item for the Developer in a follow-up WP: replace hostname interpolation in legacy error messages (lines 236/241 of config.ts) with positional index references, and update the two corresponding test assertions. All 8 ACs confirmed met. Approved for documentation pipeline."
      ]
    }
  ]
}

